<title>USA: American Comms expands chairmans role.</title>
<headline>American Comms expands chairmans role.</headline>
<dateline>ANNAPOLIS JUNCTION, Md. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Communications Services Inc Thursday said Chairman Anthony Pompliano has been named to the new position of Executive Chairman of the Board.</p>
<p>In the new position, Pompliano will be more active in the day-to-day operations of the company, the firm said..</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
